        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 4:50PM PDT until September 25 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Seattle WA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...West winds 20 to 35 mph with gusts up to 50 mph.

* WHERE...Eastern Strait of Juan de Fuca, Island County, Northern
Washington Coast, Port Townsend Area, and Western Strait of Juan de
Fuca.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM PDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
